# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — collections-c 2.3.3 CMake 静态分支 PUBLIC_HEADER 缺失 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-06
# Software: collections-c 2.3.3
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package include 路径失败) — R01 pc4-6
# Status: DRAFT — 需人工/AI 审核后 promote 为 E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. 审核 error_excerpt 与实际验证
#   2. 改名为 E0XX.kv 并移动到 knowledge/graph/
#   3. 在 knowledge/graph/index.tsv 添加一行
#   4. 编写 knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-collections-c-2.3.3-cmake-static-public-header
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|conan-verify
phase:                  package|test_package
error_signature:        Imported target ".*" includes non-existent path|
                         includes non-existent path.*include|
                         PUBLIC_HEADER.*static|
                         cmake.install\(\).*no headers

severity:               2
category:               cmake, packaging, headers, conan
match_keywords:         PUBLIC_HEADER, static library, cmake.install, include/collectc,
                         includedirs, test_package, file not found, non-existent path,
                         if(SHARED), else 分支, header install, install(TARGETS)
title:                  CMake 库仅 in if(SHARED) 分支设置 PUBLIC_HEADER 时，
                         静态构建 cmake.install() 不安装任何头文件 → 消费者 include 路径
                         不存在；配方 package() 应显式拷贝头文件到 include/<lib>/

root_cause: >
  上游 src/CMakeLists.txt 的静态分支（if(SHARED) 的 else）仅设置
  set_target_properties(... OUTPUT_NAME ...)，未设置 PUBLIC_HEADER 属性；
  install(TARGETS ... PUBLIC_HEADER DESTINATION include/<lib>) 中的 PUBLIC_HEADER
  为空，cmake.install() 实际不安装头文件。Conan 配方 package_info() 声明
  includedirs=[include/<lib>] 时，test_package 的 find_package 生成的 Imported target
  指向不存在的 include 路径，cmake.configure() 直接失败。

trigger_condition: >
  上游 CMakeLists 用 if(SHARED)/else 双分支且只在 SHARED 分支设置 PUBLIC_HEADER；
  默认静态构建；配方 package_info() 声明了 include/<lib> 子目录。

solution: >
  配方 package() 在 cmake.install() 之外显式拷贝头文件（与 SHARED 分支行为对齐）：
    from conan.tools.files import copy
    copy(self, "*.h", src=self.source_folder + "/src/include",
         dst=self.package_folder + "/include/collectc")
    copy(self, "memory/*.h", ... dst=.../include/collectc/memory)
    copy(self, "sized/*.h",  ... dst=.../include/collectc/sized)
  并保持 cpp_info.includedirs = ["include/collectc"]。

verification_cmd: >
  conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing &&
  conan-verify collections-c 2.3.3   # G2/G3/G4 PASS；test_package 编译运行通过

rec_priority:               1
rec_approach:               recipe-level
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:                   manual-edit
fallback_priority:          2
fallback_approach:          source-code-patch
fallback_description:       也可改上游 CMakeLists 给静态分支补 PUBLIC_HEADER，但改源码需
                            补丁/版本后缀，优先配方层拷贝。
forbid_1_pattern:           includedirs=.*include$.*假装|删 test_package|空壳测试
forbid_1_reason:            不安装头文件却让消费者按 include/<lib> 引用必然解析失败；
                            空壳测试违反 R34/PF3。
forbid_1_consequence:       CI L1e 反向验证或 test_package 编译失败。
causes: []
caused_by: []